Define a marker for the cvc5 patches of SymFPU.

Defines SYMFPU_CVC5_PATCH_LEVEL, the number of cvc5 patches applied to
SymFPU. cmake/FindSymFPU.cmake only accepts a system installation of SymFPU
that defines it, and cvc5 fails to compile against SymFPU headers that do not
define it. The latter catches an unpatched SymFPU that shadows the selected
one in the include path, e.g., when installed in the same prefix as GMP.

Requires symfpu-0001-fix-conversions-for-experimental-formats.patch and
symfpu-0002-fix-unpacked-exponent-width-for-small-formats.patch.

--- a/core/unpackedFloat.h
+++ b/core/unpackedFloat.h
@@ -31,6 +31,10 @@
 #ifndef SYMFPU_UNPACKED_FLOAT
 #define SYMFPU_UNPACKED_FLOAT
 
+// Defined by the cvc5 patches in cmake/deps-utils/symfpu-*.patch, which
+// cvc5 requires. Increment when adding a patch.
+#define SYMFPU_CVC5_PATCH_LEVEL 3
+
 namespace symfpu {
 
   template<class t>
